      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a38b15b8203b39bdf30b19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成员组成相当多元，有些是在“宝冢纪念”上\n被葛城王牌的表现所感动的人们──",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d3944213682c92e2106c41512e3705153047e0481631f29b548c12667056ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2ff2b48a0179172f5c8f8fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也有些人是从以前开始，\n就一直看葛城王牌的比赛，也知道她的经历，\n因此支持着她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02b6f612b7be56ce6fcf2f29911088ba58752fa4ac5a2e5237e969ad93f1030",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:961c6813ade610f5fb0a0c98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "王牌的粉丝A",
      "source_fingerprint": "9767077bce0069afa2fa12a5162a777eb00d3604177d268e2bed048c42c90176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4b2bf8dcd7e2e382fd6d1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“你在宝冢纪念时的表现真的非常热血，\n让我看得目不转睛，你一定会赢！\n我喜欢你那总是充满活力的样子。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "850af086b05a8794d0aae24062b9956aa29591e937f86daa59351718d3f43e28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f90ea998fc6977db47de362",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "王牌的粉丝B",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f108af7922d1b461bce78d2a79a81c3bb30a4350cb112a89ea3100469bd37f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f910b7953faf2603f47125",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“经典级时，\n每当你和那位千明代表之间展开热血对决，\n我都会兴奋地帮你加油。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ab8b2a81693b79cbf6feb39ada5440e8d28539e9d6ed1fea23e4997c47f0a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64853412eb0c6bec21d34e0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "附在委托内的那些\n粉丝对葛城王牌的鼓励，\n每一则都能感受到共通的“心意”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e330fc80abad9e92e540804f8f62024d023d6fc32b35383abc9556715c18852c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26844fe1d89982835bfd9c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寄来的委托内容是\n他们想要把这些“心意”\n以具体的形式直接传达给葛城王牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7fd48e4272fdd9c73fd95e54286b729064116ae7ee4f8a3bb5911a9eed8806",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45993d70e23b8619fe58edb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（就是这个）",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd93ea6fd3161b807a440d190db54780d931a836016dffc7bb3d61743ce6759a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3920422ba8a7079ec89acac1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我将收到的粉丝对葛城王牌的“心意”\n全都看过一遍后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5423836f91e4cd720fe5bb1bc504e13b729aa59d1a2dee43a0a9b8f7f8f60ad0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f6cff01e94e20266cb458f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我想到了一件\n我能够和粉丝一起\n为葛城王牌做的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4809af43c905ae2a177c29894e1afcf845fc02a91227cf6b3f2333df01285870",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048b804bc11139a61252bc85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──就这样，夏季集训即将开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65c19070efa2d920dae3d7271d5abc5b2fef37bae7cd15c801b686beb5c061e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ea5818ffa78b9930c2f582",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e4f90b59d679f54f3a8c84a8c11fe55f91cf86a898da433bbfe74a988804c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
